'''Dark Otter''' (ブラッコ, ''Burakko'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Otta-smack-u]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Into the Future]]. He was added in [[Version 3.2 Update|Version 3.2]].

